                               rdfs:comment "Relates a space group to the crystal system it belongs to. This is a fixed, deterministic crystallographic classification (each of the 230 space groups belongs to exactly one of the 7 crystal systems — e.g. space groups 16-74 are orthorhombic, 195-230 are cubic), not an independent per-structure choice, so it is asserted per SpaceGroup individual rather than per CrystalStructure."@en ;
